      "description": "OKF Agent Memory provides the `okf` CLI and MCP server for maintaining a\npersistent, version-controlled project memory for AI agents. Knowledge is\nstored as plain Markdown and YAML in an Open Knowledge Format (OKF) v0.2\nbundle, and the tool offers deterministic parsing, strict validation,\nin-memory BM25 search, and a Model Context Protocol (MCP) server so agents\ncan retrieve decisions, facts, and runbooks on demand.",
